TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}Oha!
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}, sende {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} olduğuna inanamıyorum!
